    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301191
    m_Localized: Approved site procedures and authorized training
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301192
    m_Localized: What governs real equipment and response decisions at a worksite?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301193
    m_Localized: Real equipment decisions require approved site content; the demo
      only permits its configured interaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301194
    m_Localized: In every fire regardless of conditions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301195
    m_Localized: When this scenario explicitly permits it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301196
    m_Localized: Whenever a trainee chooses it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301197
    m_Localized: When does this demo permit the training equipment interaction?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 128254958301198
