  - m_Id: 643872446124032
    m_Localized: Move to brighter, even lighting. Keep scanning gently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643872530010112
    m_Localized: Look across textured ground. Sky, plain walls, glare and darkness
      are difficult to track.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
